<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Ommeren has higher 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Van Ommeren has higher 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    94.40 vs  80.30</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.06 vs   5.24</p>
<p>    Turnover			     756.00 vs  880.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.50 vs   2.00</p>
<p>Note - Van Ommeren was expected by analysts to produce a 1996 net profit before extraordinaries of 91 to 96 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		   167.20 vs 146.20</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    30.00 vs  23.00</p>
<p>    Taxation				27.00 vs  26.20</p>
<p>    Net profit on ord activities   110.20 vs  97.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary net result	    nil vs  11.4 loss</p>
<p>    Consolidated group cos     15.80 loss vs   5.4 loss</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
